precharge pump
* GPIO: 10 kHz burst 0..3.3 V for 100 ms, then held (HI case) -- source 40 ohm
.model DSCH D(IS=2e-7 N=1.1 RS=5 CJO=10p BV=30)
.model QN NPN(IS=6.7e-15 BF=40 CJE=8p CJC=4p VAF=74 TF=300p TR=240n)
V1 g 0 PWL FILE=drv.txt
Ro g p 40
Rs p c1 1k
C1 c1 a 10n
D1 0 a DSCH
D2 a b DSCH
C2 b 0 100n
R2 b 0 100k
Rb b base 33k
Rbe base 0 100k
* collector: gate divider of Q2 from a 14.6 V source (Rgs 100k, Rg 27k)
Vbp vbp 0 24.4
Rgs vbp g2 100k
Rg g2 col 27k
Cgs vbp g2 1.65n
Q1 col base 0 QN
.control
tran 1u 200m 0 1u
let vsg = v(vbp)-v(g2)
meas tran vbss MIN v(b) from=50m to=99m
meas tran vsgmin MIN vsg from=50m to=99m
meas tran vsgmax_all MAX vsg
meas tran ton WHEN vsg=4 RISE=1
meas tran toff WHEN vsg=1 FALL=LAST
meas tran vsgend MAX vsg from=150m to=200m
.endc
.end
